extends ../layouts/main.pug

block styles
  link(rel="stylesheet", href="/css/blogDetail.css")

block content
  article.article-card
    .card-image
      img(src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3769021/pexels-photo-3769021.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1260&h=750&dpr=1", alt="Một người phụ nữ đang làm việc trên laptop")
    
    .card-meta
      .meta-item
        i.fas.fa-folder
        .meta-text
          span.meta-label Category
          span.meta-value Fashion
      .meta-item
        i.fas.fa-user
        .meta-text
          span.meta-label View
          span.meta-value 813,454
      .meta-item
        i.fas.fa-calendar-alt
        .meta-text
          span.meta-label Last Updated
          span.meta-value 25/04/2020
    
    .card-content
      h2.card-title
        a(href="#") It's Time To Think Differently About Homeschooling
      p.card-excerpt
        | Quuntur magni dolores eos qui ratione voluptatem sequi nesciunt. Neque porro quia non numquam eius modi tempora incidunt ut labore et dolore magnam dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.